WEBVTT

00:14.849 --> 00:19.633
The 545 Maroon Express was a logistical

00:19.753 --> 00:25.819
mistake. A 30-minute highway ride was not a

00:25.960 --> 00:31.724
clever risk to take. It beat the crowds, it saved

00:31.904 --> 00:38.546
us seats, but left us in the freeze. A 45-minute

00:38.686 --> 00:44.428
wait outside is an unacceptable disease. The

00:44.508 --> 00:48.830
variable has changed. His health is the

00:48.890 --> 00:55.572
priority. The system must be optimized for

00:55.632 --> 00:57.733
sustainability.

00:59.566 --> 01:06.271
The new normal at 6am A new alarm, a brand new plan

01:06.731 --> 01:12.255
Route 1 local, a slower pace A 45 minute ride, a

01:12.335 --> 01:17.319
safer space A 15 minute wait is all we get A

01:17.899 --> 01:23.603
logical and warmer set This is the system, this

01:23.863 --> 01:29.826
is the shield. The old inefficiency must yield.

01:36.730 --> 01:41.012
It stops at every local street. It stops at the

01:41.092 --> 01:46.014
New River Mall. It's not as fast, it's not

01:46.154 --> 01:51.603
expressed, but it's the logical call. We beat

01:51.643 --> 01:55.830
the rush, we beat the cold, we're safe inside the

01:55.930 --> 02:03.281
library. Before the 7am wave, a perfect

02:03.321 --> 02:10.068
victory. The variable has changed, his health

02:10.128 --> 02:16.715
is the priority. The system must be optimized

02:16.995 --> 02:19.297
for sustainability.

02:21.166 --> 02:27.289
The new normal is 6 a.m. A new alarm, a brand new

02:27.409 --> 02:32.931
plan Route 1 local, a slower pace A 45-minute

02:33.011 --> 02:38.874
ride, a safer space A 15-minute wait is all we get

02:39.354 --> 02:45.017
A logical and warm message This is the system,

02:45.037 --> 02:50.518
this is the shield. The old inefficiency must

02:50.578 --> 02:51.138
yield.

02:59.820 --> 03:04.342
System is stable. GU protocol is active.

03:06.202 --> 03:08.803
Optimal solution found.

